# Having an issue or something not working as expected?

I’m here to help & aim to respond as quickly as possible.

Please email:
hello@goblinmade.shop

When you reach out, it really helps if you include:

A brief description of the issue
What you were trying to do
Screenshots (if possible)

This makes it much easier to understand and fix the problem quickly.

# Common Questions

My data isn’t updating or saving
- Try closing and reopening the app. If the issue continues, please get in touch.

I logged something by mistake
- You can edit or remove entries directly within the app.
